## Story Information
**Title:** Track recipe count and completion ratio
**Feature:** Visual recipe data & gamification

## Description
**As an** unmotivated user,
**I want** to see the number of recipes I have created and the percentage I have completed,
**So that** I can visually track my progress and feel more motivated through a sense of achievement through a more **gamified** interface.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] The app displays the total number of recipes the user has created.
- [ ] The app shows the percentage or ratio of recipes completed by the user.

## Scenarios
- Scenario: Viewing recipe progress
  - **Given** I am a user
  - **And** I have created multiple recipes
  - **When** I look at MyRecipes
  - **Then** I should see the total number of recipes I have created
  - **And** I should see the percentage of those recipes that are marked as completed

- Scenario: Counter updates when a new recipe is created
  - **Given** I am in MyRecipes
  - **When** I create a new recipe
  - **Then** the total recipe count should increase by one

- Scenario: Progress updates when a recipe is completed
  - **Given** I am in MyRecipes
  - **When** I mark one recipe as completed
  - **Then** the percentage of recipes completed should update to reflect this change
